#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:34
msgid ""
"Prior-filing and relation prefills read only revision-reconfirmed "
"observations from the pinned authority. Missing carries remain visible as"
" missing values. The separate clean-state evaluator determines whether "
"the history is filing grade: it checks member rosters, current "
"filing/revision state, verification, local and AEAT evidence, and tightly"
" scoped no-obligation exceptions. Same-year app filing can relax only "
"certain missing-official-evidence blockers to advisory, not missing "
"values or revision divergence. M303 IVA compensation has a canonical "
"disposition-aware carry envelope, a FIFO history, and an atomic co-commit"
" contract for observation plus history. Wallet reconciliation "
"distinguishes local recurrence, live AEAT evidence, and explicit operator"
" override; its first-period zero depends on caller-supplied evidence "
"status. Annual M390 consumes exact filed M303 history and can leave an "
"unknown opening balance unresolved. Clean-state evaluation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/calculations/cross_period_clean_state.py`) "
